SUMMARY:Track Session - Malvern
DESCRIPTION:Leader: Andrew Kenchington\n\nMeet at gate entrance off Thirlst
 ane Road to College grounds. Please be prompt so we can make most of the ho
 ur. We will do a good warm up with stretching and drills (all explained and
  suitable for those ru ners new to track or advanced runners). Then a track
  session of various intervals ( no more than 4-5km total running) and can b
 e adapted to suit all abilities. We will cool down and be finished by 7.30p
 m. 400m grass track. Queries to Andy K [Phone Number Redacted].\n\nView on 
 Strava: https://www.strava.com/clubs/208705/group_events/349651203212225348
 6\n\nSynced from Strava Club 208705 on Sat\, 6 Jun @ 4:37 PM
